  "prefLabel": "Puc 2002.09 Sanctionable event",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2002.09 “Sanctionable event” means a CEPS or aggregator has:\n\n(a) Violated any provision of the rules included in this chapter or in En 2000;\n\n(b) Violated the requirements of RSA 374-F:7 or any other provision of RSA Title XXXIV applicable to CEPS or aggregators; or\n\n(c) Engaged in any unfair or deceptive acts or practices in the marketing, sale, or solicitation of electricity supply or related services.\n\nSource. #12372, eff 11-1-17; ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36 (formerly Puc 2002.20)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc2000.html"
